ositions, relationships and related material.","about.f.automations":"Automations","about.f.automationsDesc":"Scheduled and manual actions with prechecks, run history and notifications.","about.f.sync":"Git sync","about.f.syncDesc":"Commit, pull and push the vault with your system git, and resolve conflicts.","about.f.comments":"Comments","about.f.commentsDesc":"Line and selection comments with hover threads and a sidebar.","about.f.icons":"Icons","about.f.iconsDesc":"Custom icons and colors for files, folders, tabs, tags and the ribbon.","about.f.appearance":"Appearance","about.f.appearanceDesc":"Interface themes, editor colors and fonts across Obsidian and Markdown.","about.dataTitle":"Data and privacy","about.dataContent":"Your content (journals, notes, records and archives) lives in the visible huhu/ folder of your vault, so Obsidian indexes, searches and syncs it.","about.dataConfig":"Settings and runtime data (board layout, automations, agents, browser sessions) live in the hidden .huhu/ folder.","about.dataLocal":"Everything is stored locally in your vault. HUHU has no account and no server of its own.","about.creditsTitle":"Credits and licenses","about.creditsBody":"HUHU uses a source-available license. Commercial use requires prior written permission. Third-party works keep their own licenses and attribution.","about.notice":"Attributions (NOTICE)","about.thirdParty":"Third-party notices","about.licenseFile":"HUHU License"},zh:{"settings.homeGeneral":"通用设置","settings.homeModules":"功能模块","settings.homeDesc":"HUHU 的界面语言与功能模块开关。","modules.notificationsDesc":"自动化结果与提醒的收件箱。","modules.failed":"{module} 未能启动，其他功能不受影响。详情见开发者控制台。","modules.automationDesc":"定时与手动自动化。关闭会停止自动化启动的智能体，保留历史和通知，不影响独立终端。","modules.syncDesc":"用本机安装的 Git 提交、拉取和推送整个库，可手动或定时。仅桌面端；凭据由 Git 自己管理。","modules.safeDesc":"使用独立主密码，加密保存账号、密码和备注。仅桌面端。","modules.iconic":"图标","modules.iconicDesc":"自定义文件、文件夹、标签页、书签、标签、属性和功能区的图标与颜色。","settings.writeFailed":"设置保存失败，请重试。","modules.dashboard":"看板","modules.dashboardDesc":"备忘、待办、小组件和看板文件。关闭后这些服务不再启动。","modules.navigator":"笔记","modules.navigatorDesc":"在 Obsidian 左侧栏显示笔记导航器：文件夹与标签、笔记预览、键盘导航和拖放。关闭后左侧栏里的导航器随之消失。","modules.editor":"编辑器","modules.editorDesc":"Markdown 评论和复制引用。关闭后不再注册编辑器工具。","modules.terminal":"智能体","modules.terminalDesc":"桌面终端、预设工作流和编程智能体。手机端不会启动。","modules.editorOff":"编辑器已在设置中关闭。","modules.navigatorOff":"笔记导航器已在设置中关闭。","modules.disabledNotice":"这个模块已关闭。请到首页打开。","intro.title":"HUHU","intro.body":"这是 NAMEWTA 的通用工作台。首页管理看板、编辑器、智能体、图标和档案，自动化与通知连接各模块。","intro.ok":"知道了","about.tagline":"Obsidian 里的个人工作台。","about.lead":"HUHU 把看板、笔记、编程智能体、浏览器、档案、自动化和 Git 同步收进 Obsidian 里的一个三栏工作台。你的内容以普通 Markdown 和 JSON 文件保存在自己的库里。","about.version":"版本 {version}","about.license":"源码可见","about.author":"作者 NAMEWTA","about.star":"在 GitHub 上 Star","about.issues":"问题反馈","about.changelog":"更新日志","about.featuresTitle":"它能做什么","about.f.dashboard":"看板","about.f.dashboardDesc":"可拖动、可调整大小的小组件看板，含备忘、待办、习惯、记账、阅读和番茄钟。","about.f.navigator":"笔记导航器","about.f.navigatorDesc":"按文件夹和标签浏览笔记，支持搜索、预览、日历与周期笔记和键盘导航。","about.f.agents":"智能体与终端","about.f.agentsDesc":"在标签组中运行编程智能体和终端，支持恢复、历史和用量。","about.f.browser":"内置浏览器","about.f.browserDesc":"网页标签，支持个人资料、Cookie 导入、下载和材料抓取。","about.f.archives":"档案","about.f.archivesDesc":"人物与公司树，记录职位、关系和相关材料。","about.f.automations":"自动化","about.f.automationsDesc":"定时和手动操作，带前置检查、运行历史和通知。","about.f.sync":"Git 同步","about.f.syncDesc":"用系统 Git 提交、拉取和推送整个库，并处理冲突。","about.f.comments":"批注","about.f.commentsDesc":"行内和选区批注，悬停显示讨论串，并有侧边栏。","about.f.icons":"图标","about.f.iconsDesc":"自定义文件、文件夹、标签页、标签和功能区的图标与颜色。","about.f.appearance":"外观","about.f.appearanceDesc":"覆盖 Obsidian 界面与 Markdown 的界面主题、编辑器配色和字体。","about.dataTitle":"数据与隐私","about.dataContent":"你的内容（日志、笔记、记录和档案）保存在库里可见的 huhu/ 文件夹，由 Obsidian 索引、搜索和同步。","about.dataConfig":"设置和运行数据（看板布局、自动化、智能体、浏览器会话）保存在隐藏的 .huhu/ 文件夹。","about.dataLocal":"所有数据都存放在本地库中。HUHU 没有账号，也没有自己的服务器。","about.creditsTitle":"致谢与许可","about.creditsBody":"HUHU 采用源码可见许可，商用须事先取得书面授权。第三方作品保留原有许可与署名。","about.notice":"署名与来源（NOTICE）"